--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
pKa — training data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

IUPAC Dissociation Constants (primary training set)
  Compilation of experimental dissociation constants published by IUPAC.
  https://github.com/IUPAC/Dissociation-Constants

ChEMBL pKa measurements
  Extracted from ChEMBL (via czodrowskilab/Machine-learning-meets-pKa).
  ChEMBL source data licensed CC-BY-SA 3.0. EMBL-EBI, https://www.ebi.ac.uk/chembl/
  https://github.com/czodrowskilab/Machine-learning-meets-pKa

Uni-pKa (dwar-iBond microscopic pKa)
  Licensed Apache-2.0. https://github.com/dptech-corp/Uni-pKa

SAMPL6 / SAMPL7 (validation / benchmark only — not used to train the weights)
  Community blind-challenge datasets. https://github.com/samplchallenges

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Aqueous solubility — training data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

AqSolDB (pretraining)
  Sorkun, M.C., Khetan, A., Er, S. "AqSolDB, a curated reference set of aqueous
  solubility." Sci. Data 6, 143 (2019). Source data licensed CC-BY 4.0.

BigSolDB 2.0 (temperature-dependent fine-tuning)
  Temperature-resolved aqueous solubility measurements, published via Zenodo.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bond dissociation energy (BDE)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

alfabet (pretrained model)
  Used as an installed dependency (St. John et al., NREL). alfabet's pretrained
  network is downloaded by that package under its own license and is NOT
  redistributed as part of this repository's weights.

